{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "crosswoz_10040_turn4", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "zh", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "你好！很高兴为你提供旅游建议。根据你的需求，我推荐你去汉石桥湿地公园和沃龙公园。这两个地方都是北京周边的自然风光优美的免费景点，适合与朋友一同游玩。\n\n### 汉石桥湿地公园\n汉石桥湿地公园位于北京市顺义区，具体地址是北京市顺义区后沙峪镇汉石桥村市地公园西门200米路北。这里环境清幽，是城市中难得的自然氧吧。你提到的宝香烧烤区可能是在附近，但请注意，宝香烧烤区是否在公园内", "tts_n_chars": 187, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 541, "tts_text_sha256": "69bac557b4c21caabfbae67dcc0ddead360fddfd2cd5df393b90c454cc3576f1", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277245151830931, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277245157508179, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277257146581674, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277257146678071, "tts_done_ns": 277277265445986, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1091.1569631024165, "tts_playable_peak": 4341.0, "tts_total_bytes": 1973248}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
