{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "crosswoz_10331_turn4", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "zh", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "你好！根据你的需求，我已经为你安排了以下信息：\n\n1. **住宿**：你朋友可以入住北京丽思卡尔顿酒店，华茂中心。这是一家设施齐全、服务优质的酒店，应该能满足你的需求。\n\n2. **周边餐馆**：酒店附近有全聚德、朝阳北路店、菊气大月城店等餐馆，你可以选择去这些地方品尝特色美食。\n\n3. **豆浆餐馆**：我推荐你们去鱼豆集大徽司店。这家餐馆不仅豆浆品质上乘，而且环境优雅，适合聚餐。根据评价，这家餐馆的评分很高，", "tts_n_chars": 208, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 570, "tts_text_sha256": "46fee1832a412a89473bb72bf63e7c330464850ee5dda4444c743bdbe4c7b8c0", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277279269814347, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277279274924855, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277290799665507, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277290799721805, "tts_done_ns": 277314362481229, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1082.002885024997, "tts_playable_peak": 4252.0, "tts_total_bytes": 2224640}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "crosswoz_10382_turn4", "mode": "b_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "zh", "text_source": "b_first_sentence", "tts_text": "对于您周末与邻居的聚餐，中国大饭店确实是一个不错的选择，它既适合朋友聚会，又提供相对经济实惠的餐饮选择。", "tts_n_chars": 52, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 156, "tts_text_sha256": "f95bd15dd523f9d8f533a85973a5c4ef81953534d8303b37e9b2cced547751cc", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277314369152613, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277314374255032, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277325010446509, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277325010503715, "tts_done_ns": 277325091561595, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 2527.0579762058765, "tts_playable_peak": 10002.0, "tts_total_bytes": 662016}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
