{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "crosswoz_10382_turn4", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "zh", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "关于餐馆的选择，中国大饭店确实是一个不错的选择，适合朋友聚会。这家餐厅的营业时间是早上10点到晚上10点，非常方便。至于周边的餐馆，北京全聚德王府井店和外婆家北京FM店都是不错的选择，可以根据你们的口味和需求来选择。\n\n至于你想找的景点，考虑到评分和票价，我推荐你可以去北京的故宫。故宫的评分非常高，达到了4.8分，门票价格为60元，但如果你指的是包含其他额外服务或体验的票价，可能需要200元以上。故宫不仅历史悠久，而且", "tts_n_chars": 211, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 601, "tts_text_sha256": "bfd44b85a926b30234e942c53233cb1627847df142fdc53f70bba4a085ad1b42", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277331565842865, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277331571868631, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277351751799108, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277351751888206, "tts_done_ns": 277368035918985, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 2444.784709628855, "tts_playable_peak": 8716.0, "tts_total_bytes": 2141184}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
