{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "crosswoz_11406_turn5", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "zh", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "你好！根据你的需求，我为你推荐北京的“北京湘江带四酒店”。这家酒店提供洗衣服务，价格在300到400元之间，评价不错，评分大约在4.2左右。酒店周边有多个景点，如石不岔海、宋庆林故居和中古楼，这些地方都受到游客的好评。\n\n如果你想找一个可以游玩两小时左右的景点，门票价格在150到200元之间，我推荐你去“故宫博物院”。故宫博物院门票价格大约在60元，但如果你购买“故宫博物院", "tts_n_chars": 188, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 526, "tts_text_sha256": "25b3af88ed7b78d58466070b90e9c7c7384e12c3987bced2bd6616e47b683a22", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277407477641898, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277407483304830, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277420991799694, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277420991858592, "tts_done_ns": 277440328549316, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1391.6691124074728, "tts_playable_peak": 4886.0, "tts_total_bytes": 1803264}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0023_turn4", "mode": "b_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "b_first_sentence", "tts_text": "是的，Goldenwook 在北区提供中等价位的中国菜，这应该符合您的需求。", "tts_n_chars": 38, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 92, "tts_text_sha256": "1024bfd704d7a7a79c98855dbd2a79ca5dd1d3161a66db25199ecbcbf6c8370c", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277440338283279, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277440343268990, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277445829498439, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277445829551334, "tts_done_ns": 277445853541917, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1709.5025702713494, "tts_playable_peak": 6979.0, "tts_total_bytes": 317952}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
