{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0023_turn4", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "您提到的Goldenwook餐厅位于镇北，提供中等价位的中国菜，这应该符合您的需求。关于预订，我可以帮您安排周六中午12点的预订，但似乎预订失败了。那么，我建议您尝试在上午11点预订，是否可行？\n\n关于您的预订，我已经为您安排了周六中午12点在Goldenwook的预订，地点在镇北。同时，Mingyu餐厅也是您的另一个选择。如果您需要在Mingyu餐厅预订，我们可以按照同样的时间安排。\n\n至于住宿，您需要提供更具体的信息，例如您计划停留的时间", "tts_n_chars": 223, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 585, "tts_text_sha256": "169b2c0cea4cbcdaa83f1705d82b4dcf953a62d2ec04931de95a95e36f9adba2", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277452345040892, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277452350537732, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277463302319709, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277463302384789, "tts_done_ns": 277485667626441, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 2101.3867148570357, "tts_playable_peak": 7299.0, "tts_total_bytes": 1968640}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn4", "mode": "b_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "b_first_sentence", "tts_text": "对于您的住宿需求，我理解您需要一个提供免费停车场的地方，但您也提到在剑桥地区找不到符合条件的酒店。", "tts_n_chars": 49, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 147, "tts_text_sha256": "696b57ad3d5ccd79bd33e645a262204953b40b0fd8f1839c066037be29e6580a", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277485674433656, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277485679949202, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277494340891053, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277494340955007, "tts_done_ns": 277494391524566, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1241.8231693715154, "tts_playable_peak": 5340.0, "tts_total_bytes": 503296}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn4", "mode": "a_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "a_first_sentence", "tts_text": "在剑桥确实很难找到提供免费停车位的酒店，因为剑桥市中心的停车资源非常有限。", "tts_n_chars": 37, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 111, "tts_text_sha256": "6b0f4a757fc4fde4b27d72bafcc2933e56d7be43178f391692e862cff7f08880", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277494397895856, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277494404468399, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277500893533587, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277500893589037, "tts_done_ns": 277500925800692, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 680.6657317425198, "tts_playable_peak": 2179.0, "tts_total_bytes": 361472}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn4", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "在剑桥确实很难找到提供免费停车位的酒店，因为剑桥市中心的停车资源非常有限。不过，你可以考虑周边地区，比如剑桥的南部、西部或者东部，这些地方可能有提供免费停车位的住宿选择。例如，剑桥的南部地区，如Sawston、Trumpington 或者 Girton，这些地方的住宿可能提供免费停车服务。\n\n如果你愿意稍微远一点，剑桥西部的几个小镇，如Histon、Chesterton 或者 Trumpington 也都是不错的选择。这些地方的住宿通常提供免费停车位，并且距离剑桥市中心也不算太远", "tts_n_chars": 242, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 610, "tts_text_sha256": "02407f02fc7294dbe2b28750ba4b7a14281165449e5b102ea56d7ef7e93a84de", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277500931650728, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277500938710675, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277515476368906, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277515476433984, "tts_done_ns": 277538354698968, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 3374.0663072351344, "tts_playable_peak": 11091.0, "tts_total_bytes": 2144256}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn5", "mode": "b_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "b_first_sentence", "tts_text": "对于您的需求，我理解您需要在剑桥附近找到一个提供免费停车场的住宿地点。", "tts_n_chars": 35, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 105, "tts_text_sha256": "a8cd24820e9afcac1cd6f8388b4d24136ce3ea95858634a4e95194e27003f0e9", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277538360774856, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277538366919819, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277544261833490, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277544261899231, "tts_done_ns": 277544289871617, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 1718.1651396562293, "tts_playable_peak": 8320.0, "tts_total_bytes": 341504}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn5", "mode": "a_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "a_first_sentence", "tts_text": "考虑到您的需求，我建议您考虑剑桥周边的几个地区，如剑桥西（Cambridge West）或剑桥南（Cambridge South）附近的住宿选项。", "tts_n_chars": 73, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 161, "tts_text_sha256": "7b3e29a259f98c469a4ec9841deaf84272eb5af7f523e972e99993306ef2b506", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277544297126588, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277544301690794, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277554745265936, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277554745323103, "tts_done_ns": 277554811481588, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 833.9351279224791, "tts_playable_peak": 2850.0, "tts_total_bytes": 599552}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0183_turn5", "mode": "a_full_response", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "a_full_response", "tts_text": "考虑到您的需求，我建议您考虑剑桥周边的几个地区，如剑桥西（Cambridge West）或剑桥南（Cambridge South）附近的住宿选项。虽然剑桥本身可能没有提供免费停车场的酒店，但周边地区通常会有更多选择。\n\n在剑桥西，您可以考虑查找一些提供免费停车场的民宿或公寓式酒店。这些住宿通常会提供更多的灵活性，并且可能在价格上更具竞争力。您可以通过在线旅行网站或住宿预订平台进行搜索，输入“Cambridge West”和“免费停车场”作为搜索关键词，以找到符合您需求的住宿。\n\n同样", "tts_n_chars": 244, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 638, "tts_text_sha256": "62a494384501cf45738faf14cc0947c4493358989047b78b7f6a0da3f3b52e66", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277554818535947, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277554823376948, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277564108501344, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277564108554691, "tts_done_ns": 277590081056081, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 720.8459144132565, "tts_playable_peak": 2170.0, "tts_total_bytes": 2149376}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
{"schema_version": "ttfa_unified/1", "run_id": "r7_tts_control", "sample_id": "multiwoz_MUL0666_turn4", "mode": "b_first_sentence", "repeat_idx": 0, "language": "en", "text_source": "b_first_sentence", "tts_text": "根据您的需求，我找到了两个位于Asuri地区的客舍，它们都提供免费停车服务。", "tts_n_chars": 38, "tts_n_bytes_utf8": 104, "tts_text_sha256": "b6d7bc0eed4ff85575e1138f178d2f6b108bc5af6caf97c872a116f5f1b3fb75", "tts": {"tts_request_start_ns": 277590088271639, "tts_response_headers_ns": 277590092878304, "first_pcm_byte_ns": 277595734625147, "first_playable_pcm_ns": 277595734677378, "tts_done_ns": 277595762035765, "tts_first_chunk_bytes": 512, "tts_playable_rms": 2208.110128566769, "tts_playable_peak": 8745.0, "tts_total_bytes": 331264}, "terminal_state": "success", "fatal": false, "error": "", "config_hash": "cbaebb471c111750c38095d51f722ee414e057d14ed5c7990e1d1961c952e3c8", "schedule_hash": "296c8e1e10c59f0ce86432651c0c696547c49035aa65db86fbf1d23e533437ef"}
